n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e9487c99-c1bc-4bc9-bbda-cfb0e5e01bee</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e9487c99-c1bc-4bc9-bbda-cfb0e5e01bee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e9487c99-c1bc-4bc9-bbda-cfb0e5e01bee\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melkor\" title=\"Melkor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Melkor.png/25px-Portrait_Melkor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Melkor.png/38px-Portrait_Melkor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Melkor.png/50px-Portrait_Melkor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melkor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Melkor.png/25px-Portrait_Melkor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Portrait_Melkor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melkor\" title=\"Melkor\">Melkor</a>, who can be found at <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple_Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Open Hand Temple Cellar\">Open Hand Temple Cellar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;95&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1045</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Please, Father Lorgan, Rector Yannis, if you've any food to spare, our stomachs yowl at night like kicked dogs. Carrots, apples - we'll even crunch an onion if that's what you've got. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Yours,\n</p><p>Thuldra Thuldrin\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214019\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1864/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30908/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7377/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936750/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.204      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.204      1 -total\n 56.93%   24.025      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.91%   21.065     19 Template:Trim\n 21.67%    9.145      2 Template:Uid\n 15.71%    6.630      3 Template:Icon_link\n 15.32%    6.465      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.56%    5.301      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.99%    4.637      2 Template:CharLink\n 10.11%    4.265      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12851-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214019 and revision id 341154. Rendering was triggered because: diff-page\n -->\n</div>"}